  "releaseNotes": "Utf8MapExtensions:\n      - Migrated all convenience overloads for byte and char spans from Core to Toolkit as Extension Methods.\n      - Restored high-level API support for TryAdd, TryGetValue, and TryRemove using ReadOnlySpan of char and byte.\n      - Added specialized TryResolvePrefix extensions for both UTF-8 and UTF-16 path resolution.\n      - Maintained zero-overhead performance by leveraging AggressiveInlining on all extension wrappers.",
